#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to find answers to questions or problems you encounter while using IBM "
"Quantum Platform or Qiskit Runtime"
msgstr ""
"Paano makahanap ng mga sagot sa mga tanong o problema na narararanasan mo "
"habang ginagamit ang IBM Quantum Platform o Qiskit Runtime"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Suporta"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Support {#support}"
msgstr "Suporta {#support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"get-help-with-qiskit-and-ibm-quantum-platform\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Get help with IBM Quantum Platform and Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-quantum-"
"platform-and-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Kumuha ng tulong sa IBM Quantum Platform at Qiskit {#get-help-with-ibm-"
"quantum-platform-and-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"special programs, and Open Plan (excludes Trial accounts):**\n"
msgstr ""
"**Premium Plan, On-Prem Plan, Direct Access, Flex Plan, Pay-As-You-Go Plan, "
"mga espesyal na programa, at Open Plan (hindi kasama ang mga Trial "
"account):**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All support inquiries must be submitted through the [IBM Cloud&reg; Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depending on your "
"account type, you can either open a Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) or a "
"Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Ensure you have "
"selected the appropriate IBM Cloud account (your institutional cloud account"
" or any non-trial account) in the account switcher.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lahat ng mga katanungan para sa suporta ay dapat isumite sa pamamagitan ng "
"[IBM Cloud&reg; Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form). Depende sa uri ng "
"iyong account, maaari kang magbukas ng Cloud Case (Topic: Qiskit Runtime) o "
"Technical Issue (Topic: Report-an-Issue::Qiskit Runtime). Tiyaking napili mo"
" ang tamang IBM Cloud account (ang iyong institutional cloud account o "
"anumang non-trial account) sa account switcher.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To see all your open IBM Cloud cases or to open a new case, visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Support Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para makita ang lahat ng iyong bukas na IBM Cloud case o para magbukas ng "
"bagong kaso, bisitahin ang [IBM Cloud Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Please reach out for any technical matter, including platform issues, job "
"errors, Qiskit guidance, or broader quantum computing questions. Our team "
"includes technical experts ready to assist across this full range of "
"topics.\n"
msgstr ""
"Makipag-ugnayan para sa anumang teknikal na bagay, kasama na ang mga isyu sa"
" platform, mga error sa trabaho, gabay sa Qiskit, o mas malawak na mga "
"tanong tungkol sa quantum computing. Ang aming koponan ay may mga teknikal "
"na eksperto na handang tumulong sa buong hanay ng mga paksa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Community support:**\n"
msgstr "**Suporta ng komunidad:**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Have a Trial account or looking for other support options?  [Join the Qiskit"
" Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) to get help from our large "
"community of users and experts. In Slack you will find topical channels such"
" as #qiskit-runtime, #ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-"
"ecosystem, and many more.\n"
msgstr ""
"May Trial account ka ba o naghahanap ng iba pang mga opsyon sa suporta? "
"[Sumali sa Qiskit Slack community](https://qisk.it/join-slack) para makakuha"
" ng tulong mula sa aming malaking komunidad ng mga gumagamit at eksperto. Sa"
" Slack mahahanap mo ang mga topical na channel tulad ng #qiskit-runtime, "
"#ibm-quantum-platform, #qiskit-transpiler, #qiskit-ecosystem, at marami "
"pa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can also use [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) for "
"support from the wider community about quantum computing and programming-"
"related questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari ka ring gumamit ng [Stack "
"Exchange](https://quantumcomputing.stackexchange.com/?tags=qiskit) para sa "
"suporta mula sa mas malawak na komunidad tungkol sa quantum computing at mga"
" tanong na may kaugnayan sa programming.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Having trouble creating an account or logging in? {#having-trouble-creating-"
"an-account-or-logging-in}"
msgstr ""
"Nagkakaproblema sa paglikha ng account o pag-login? {#having-trouble-"
"creating-an-account-or-logging-in}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you get an error when you create an IBM Cloud&reg; account,** first "
"check whether you have access to the [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) on IBM Cloud.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kung may error ka kapag gumagawa ng IBM Cloud&reg; account,** suriin muna "
"kung mayroon kang access sa [Support "
"Center](https://cloud.ibm.com/unifiedsupport/cases/form) sa IBM Cloud.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have access to the \"Create Case\" page, choose Account (Managing "
"your account and resources) as the category, followed by Account "
"verification as the Subtopic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung mayroon kang access sa pahina ng \"Create Case\", piliin ang Account "
"(Managing your account and resources) bilang kategorya, at pagkatapos ay "
"Account verification bilang Subtopic.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not have access, open a case on the [Create an Account, Login or "
"Billing Request](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung wala kang access, magbukas ng kaso sa pahina ng [Create an Account, "
"Login or Billing Request](https://watson.service-"
"now.com/x_ibmwc_open_case_app.do#!/create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are getting an error while trying to create an account and **your "
"country is on the [Personal use "
"availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-"
"getting-started#signup-personalaccts) list,** explore the following "
"options:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung nakakakuha ka ng error habang sinusubukang gumawa ng account at **ang "
"iyong bansa ay nasa listahan ng [Personal use "
"availability](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-account-"
"getting-started#signup-personalaccts),** tuklasin ang mga sumusunod na "
"opsyon:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use [Documentation](/docs) and [Learning](/learning) resources "
"without an account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari mong gamitin ang mga mapagkukunan ng [Dokumentasyon](/docs) at "
"[Pagkatuto](/learning) nang walang account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are a student or educator at a degree-granting accredited academic "
"institution, you can create a [SkillsBuild Technology Access "
"account](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (see the [SkillsBuild "
"Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) for more "
"information).\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ikaw ay isang estudyante o guro sa isang degree-granting accredited na "
"institusyong akademiko, maaari kang gumawa ng [SkillsBuild Technology Access"
" account](https://github.com/academic-"
"initiative/documentation/blob/main/academic-initiative/how-to/How-to-"
"register-with-the-IBM-Academic-Initiative/readme.md) (tingnan ang "
"[SkillsBuild Technology Access FAQ](https://academic.ibm.com/a2mt/faq#/) "
"para sa karagdagang impormasyon).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) for 30 "
"days of free access (Note that you will likely lose access at the end of the"
" trial).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Gumawa ng Trial account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) para "
"sa 30 araw na libreng access (Pansinin na malamang mawawala ang iyong access"
" sa katapusan ng trial).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**If you see the message \"This account is inactive\",** visit the [IBM "
"Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) to learn why and how to fix it, or access [IBM "
"Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) to verify if you have any pending actions to "
"complete in your account.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kung makita mo ang mensaheng \"This account is inactive\",** bisitahin ang"
" [IBM Cloud Docs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-"
"ts_accnt_inactive) para malaman kung bakit at kung paano ito ayusin, o "
"i-access ang [IBM Cloud](https://cloud.ibm.com) para ma-verify kung mayroon "
"kang mga nakabinbing aksyon na kailangang kumpletuhin sa iyong account.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"If you are the **owner** of a Pay-As-You-Go or Subscription account, you need to create an IBM Cloud account and provide billing information for verification.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"caution\" title=\"Tandaan\">\n"
"Kung ikaw ang **may-ari** ng isang Pay-As-You-Go o Subscription account, kailangan mong gumawa ng IBM Cloud account at magbigay ng impormasyon sa pagsingil para sa pag-verify.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are **invited to join** an account, simply accept the email "
"invitation and follow the [provided steps](/guides/cloud-setup-invited) to "
"gain access without providing billing information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kung ikaw ay **iniimbitahan na sumali** sa isang account, tanggapin lang ang"
" imbitasyon sa email at sundin ang [mga ibinigay na hakbang](/guides/cloud-"
"setup-invited) para makakuha ng access nang hindi nagbibigay ng impormasyon "
"sa pagsingil.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Trial account owners** can create an Open Plan instance for 30 days "
"without providing billing information. At the end of the trial, users must "
"provide billing information to verify and continue using their account. User"
" will *not be charged* if they continue using the free Open Plan, but can "
"choose to upgrade to other paid plans at that time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang mga **may-ari ng Trial account** ay maaaring lumikha ng Open Plan "
"instance sa loob ng 30 araw nang hindi nagbibigay ng impormasyon sa "
"pagsingil. Sa katapusan ng trial, ang mga gumagamit ay kailangang magbigay "
"ng impormasyon sa pagsingil para ma-verify at patuloy na magamit ang "
"kanilang account. Ang gumagamit ay *hindi sisingilin* kung patuloy nilang "
"gagamitin ang libreng Open Plan, ngunit maaari silang mag-upgrade sa iba "
"pang mga bayad na plano sa oras na iyon.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For more information about IBM Cloud accounts, visit the [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"Para sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa mga IBM Cloud account, bisitahin ang pahina ng [IBM Cloud account FAQs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-accountfaqs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Open-source support {#open-source-support}"
msgstr "Suporta para sa open-source {#open-source-support}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [Open-source resources](/guides/) for details on contributing code "
"to Qiskit. Information there includes the [code of conduct](/guides/code-of-"
"conduct), PDF license agreements for "
"[individual](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) and "
"[corporate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf) contributors, [version strategy](/guides/qiskit-sdk-version-"
"strategy), and the "
"[contributor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) "
"and [maintainer](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md) "
"guides.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tingnan ang [Mga mapagkukunan ng Open-source](/guides/) para sa mga detalye "
"sa pag-ambag ng code sa Qiskit. Kasama sa impormasyong naroroon ang [code of"
" conduct](/guides/code-of-conduct), mga PDF na kasunduan sa lisensya para sa"
" mga [indibidwal](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-cla.pdf) "
"at [korporasyon](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/open-source/qiskit-corporate-"
"cla.pdf) na kontribyutor, [estratehiya sa bersyon](/guides/qiskit-sdk-"
"version-strategy), at ang mga gabay para sa "
"[kontribyutor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) "
"at "
"[tagapanatili](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/MAINTAINING.md).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To report bugs, make feature requests, and see what's coming in future "
"releases, visit the individual GitHub repositories:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para mag-ulat ng mga bug, gumawa ng mga kahilingan para sa feature, at "
"makita kung ano ang darating sa mga susunod na release, bisitahin ang mga "
"indibidwal na GitHub repository:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit SDK](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Runtime](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Serverless](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-serverless)\n"

#. type: Plain text
